    "Thirteen cloud tests and six exact-code baseline checks passed. Tests cover all identities/case pointers/hashes, gap/member/reference counts, route-key versus coverage semantics, legacy unknown eligibility, mean/branch/non-additive metadata, CSV JSON, queue consistency, catalog-join mutations and file caps. No ocean fields, interpolation, numerical depth derivation or new measurement. All validation sequential on one idle cloud CPU; local metadata/hash/exact retention only.",
