    "Modelinventoryv48remains96/111regional support,302supported27unresolved and zero whole-current physical profiles/volumes. Referenceinventoryv2remains715scoped references/101owners. Frozenregisterv48, all prior pieces,102eddybaseline,main/runtime/queryUI/preview preserved. Goal unfinished; collection categories do not authorize cutoff/window/selection retuning."
